Analysis:
The hamburger menu dropdown is too wide. We need to update both the set_width method in the HamburgerMenuView class and potentially add CSS to constrain the dropdown's width.

Steps:
1. Update the hamburger menu view to set a narrower width
2. Adjust the CSS to better control dropdown width

